---
import { towns } from '../data/site';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="service-area dark-section section-space"><div class="container area-layout"><div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow"><span class="section-number">08 /</span> Ici, tout près</p><h2>Proches de<br /><em>vos projets.</em></h2><p>Notre point d’ancrage, c’est Vichy.<br />Notre terrain de travail, ce sont les maisons<br class="desktop-break" /> qui font vivre ses alentours.</p><ul class="town-list">{towns.map(town=><li><a href={`/contact?ville=${encodeURIComponent(town)}`}>{town} <Icon /></a></li>)}</ul><p class="small-note">Votre commune n’est pas dans la liste ?<br />Parlons-en, tout simplement.</p></div><figure class="area-map" data-reveal><svg viewBox="0 0 600 620" role="img" aria-labelledby="map-title map-description"><title id="map-title">Maison Ardent autour de Vichy</title><desc id="map-description">Schéma indicatif : Saint-Pourçain-sur-Sioule au nord, Vichy et Bellerive-sur-Allier au centre, Cusset à l’est et Saint-Yorre au sud.</desc><defs><pattern id="map-grid" width="60" height="60" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M60 0H0V60" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-opacity=".045" /></pattern></defs><rect width="600" height="620" fill="url(#map-grid)" /><circle cx="300" cy="318" r="205" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".15" stroke-dasharray="3 8" /><circle cx="300" cy="318" r="132" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".1" /><path d="M274 0c-45 57 66 62 24 111s-6 55-26 108 59 57 12 120-47 102-12 150 4 68 42 131" fill="none" stroke="#b6a18a" stroke-width="2" stroke-opacity=".4" /><path d="m145 99 125 58 64 129 121 38M206 310l125-20 5 218M113 439l192-91" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-opacity=".12" /><text x="247" y="572" class="map-river" transform="rotate(-9 247 572)">L’Allier</text><g class="map-town"><circle cx="190" cy="130" r="4" /><text x="210" y="135">Saint-Pourçain-sur-Sioule</text><circle cx="419" cy="280" r="4" /><text x="431" y="268">Cusset</text><circle cx="241" cy="341" r="4" /><text x="63" y="367">Bellerive-sur-Allier</text><circle cx="337" cy="470" r="4" /><text x="350" y="475">Saint-Yorre</text></g><circle cx="323" cy="317" r="25" fill="#b98c68" fill-opacity=".12" /><circle cx="323" cy="317" r="13" fill="#b98c68" fill-opacity=".15" /><circle cx="323" cy="317" r="5" fill="#c5a183" /><text x="343" y="334" class="map-vichy">Vichy</text><path d="M532 79V40m-7 8 7-8 7 8" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".45" fill="none" /><text x="527" y="29" class="map-north">N</text></svg><figcaption>Vichy & ses environs <span>Schéma indicatif, non contractuel</span></figcaption></figure></div></section>
